msgctxt "148"
msgid "You! You gotta help me! They're gonna murder me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "Che succede?"

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Those guys there..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Hey, c'mon now! You know we don't get outsiders involved in this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Garbage belongs in the dump, doesn't it? See, we're all about the "
"environment. You gotta sort your trash! Gwahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "You wanna tell me what you're doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Takin' out the trash. Or if you wanna be cute about it, \"hobo hunting.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"We're cleanin' up the stinkin' hobos in this part of town. Like they say, "
"everyone's gotta pitch in to keep the city clean."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"These punks... They didn't just go for my shelter, but they went after "
"Tatsu... And Masa..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"C'mon, pal. Just let us handle this garbage. Don't worry, we'll give it a "
"real good beating."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "You bastards..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "We'll see who gets that beating."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"And what's that supposed to mean, old man? You think someone's gonna give "
"<Italic>us</Italic> a smackdown?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"That would be me. Dumb kids like you should stick to your tree house clubs. "
"We've got our own trash to deal with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"Pfft... hahahahah! No way, man! Is this some kinda joke? Oh, man, you're "
"killin' me here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"What can one old dude like you do, anyway? C'mon. Let's teach 'em a lesson!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "All right. Fine. This isn't my place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Aaaaagh!"
msgstr "Aaaargh!"

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Hey, he's tryin' to get away! After him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Now you listen good... Don't ever mess with us again. We clear, buddy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "*coughs* Argh... dammit! Why ain'tcha scared of us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "The Kamurocho I grew up in is very, very different from yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr "Urgh..."

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"These guys are a part of this community. You kids are just new trash on the "
"block. So don't touch them again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Nrgh... This isn't over, old man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "Thank you so much!"
msgstr "Grazie mille!"

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"You ever get in a pinch like that, just run. You don't want to tangle with "
"those punks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "I have a favor to ask you⑬from one man of Kamurocho to another!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "Oh, yeah? What's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "I need you to help our friends!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "Help how?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid ""
"As it happens, those punks have been targeting us homeless for a reason."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "They stormed our main shelter, and turned it into their own hideout!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "Some abandoned building in Kamurocho, I take it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid ""
"Yeah. When Kamurocho Hills was slated for construction in Purgatory three "
"years ago, we had to hole up somewhere else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid ""
"But now those thugs have driven us out of our building... and whenever they "
"see us, they beat us down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "They're the worst of the worst."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid ""
"These young thugs are too much for us! Can you step in for us, and take back"
" the Dragon Palace once and for all?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "Did you say it's the \"Dragon Palace\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "Yep! That's what we've been calling the place. The Dragon Palace!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid ""
"(The name sounds familiar... I feel like I heard about this Dragon Palace "
"some three years back.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "Where is this Dragon Palace, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid ""
"It's behind the MEB info center! So how 'bout it? Wanna take the Dragon "
"Palace back from these punks?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid ""
"Sure. Kamurocho is no place for that kind of toxic mold. We can't let it go "
"unchecked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid "I'm not going to let some pack of kids ruin my town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid ""
"I... I'm not sure what you're gettin' at, but thanks all the same! You're "
"our savior! Good luck out there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr "Capito."

msgctxt "988"
msgid ""
"(He said the Dragon Palace was behind the MEB info center. I'll have to "
"check it out sometime.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid "We'll see who gets that beating."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid "(I should just butt out.)"
msgstr ""

